 text-ink\"><p>Navsari has the facilities of an Upashraya, Ayambilshaala etc. More than 700 Jain families live here. Shri Tapovan Sanskar Dham is at a distance of 6 kilometers from here. From here the pilgrimage places of Sisodara, Gandevi, Surat, Alipur are close to it.</p><p>Dandi Beach, the site of the Salt Satyagraha carried out by Mahatma Gandhi, is 19 kilometers away from here. Surat is 31 kilometers away. You can avail the benefit of darshan and worship of 4 out of 108 Parshvanaths by visiting both Surat and Navsari pilgrimages.</p><p>Scripture:- Navsari Parshvanath has been mentioned in the scriptures like &quot;Teerthamala&quot;, &quot;Vastu Shastra&quot;, &quot;Shashwat Teerthamala&quot;, &quot;Prabha Panchsheel&quot;, &quot;Suryapur Chaityaparipati&quot;, &quot;Shri Shankheshwar Parshvanath Chhand&quot;, &quot;108 Namgarbhit Shri Parshvanath Stavan&quot;, &quot;Shri Parshvanath Nammala&quot;, &quot;108 Name Steps of Shri Parshvanath Prabhu&quot; etc. An idol of Sri Navsari Parshvanath is also in the Kalikund Parshvanath Temple in Santa Cruz, Mumbai.</p><p>Praise: O worshiped God appeared from the dream-informed land, through the Darshan of his mind the devotees attained the new perfection of religion, and ruled the city of Navsari along with Chovis Jinwar. &quot;Shri Navsari Parshva Ne Bhave Karoon Hum Vandana.&quot;</p><p>Chant Mantra:- &quot;Om Hree Arham Shri Navsari Parshvanathaya Namah.&quot;</p><p>Trust:- Shri Navsari Parshvanath Shwetambar Jain Tirth, Madhumati, Chowk Bazar, Navsari - 396445, District: Valsad, State: Gujarat, India. Phone: 02637-258882.</p><p>Shri 108 Parshvanath Stuti: Jena Vadan Num Tej Nirakhi Sun in the sky, Vali Netrana Shubh Piyush Pami Chandra Nahaye Jagae, Jeni Kripa Vrishti Thaki Aa Vadalao Varasatan, &quot;Shankheshwara&quot; Lord Parshva Ne Bhave Karu Vandana.</p><p>Photo: Shri Navsari Parshvanath Temple, Madhumati, Navsari. The pink colored idol of Lord Shri Navsari Parshvanath is established in this temple. The white statue of Lord Shri Adeshwar is also present in the temple premises.</p><p>Praise:</p><p>Atit Chovishi Tana Navama Shri Damodar Prabhu,</p><p>Ashadhi Shravak asks Mara Tarak Vibhu,</p><p>When Lord Parshva woke up, he worshiped the idol and worshiped it.</p><p>&quot;Shankheshwara&quot; Lord Parshva has worshiped me and I worship him (3)</p></article><nav class=\"mt-14 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-sandstone-deep/60 pt-6\"><span></span><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-1.5 text-right font-ui text-sm text-ink-soft hover:text-maroon transition-colors\" href=\"/en/tirtha/tirtha-003\"><span class=\"max-w-[10rem] truncate sm:max-w-xs\">Shri Sahastrafna Parshwanath, Shri Surajmandan Parshwanath and Shri Vighnahara Parshwanath</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></nav></div></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-sandstone-deep/60 py-8\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 font-ui text-xs text-ink-soft flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p>१०८ पार्श्वनाथ तीर्थ दर्शन — श्री पार्श्वनाथ भगवान के तीर्थों का डिजिटल संकलन</p><p>Original source: Rajendra Kumar Jain, Parshv Sadan, Parshv Nagar, Dungarpur</p></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/40e0f9pufs6g4.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[20256,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3vsl20q6wdw12.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2dd4xso-5pqft.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"SessionBootstrap\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3vsl20q6wdw12.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2dd4xso-5pqft.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mr